OL,5,G1830 Home and Away
OL,6,     FZane loses hope. Levi's fuelled by
OL,7,     Fanger. Is Sonny's job on the line?
OL,8,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,9,     FDocumentary series. Six patients
OL,10,     Fcome in to see the Bradford
OL,11,     Fdoctors about their chronic pain
OL,12,     Fissues.
OL,13,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,14,     FSister Vicky faces a barrage of
OL,15,     Fproblems with no beds in the
OL,16,     Fhospital and the vital red phone
OL,17,     Fout of order. A 10-year-old comes
OL,18,     Fin with a dangerously fast heart
OL,19,     Frate.
