OL,5,G0100 Motorway Cops: Catching Britain's
OL,6,G     Speeders
OL,7,     FOn the outskirts of Congleton, a
OL,8,     FPC tails a suspected drink driver,
OL,9,     Fwho is furious when stopped for
OL,10,     Fquestioning. And there's a
OL,11,     Fthree-vehicle crash in Cheshire.
OL,12,G0155 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,13,     FOn 'Manic Monday' in Barnsley
OL,14,     FCasualty, a 66-year-old patient
OL,15,     Fhas a dangerously high heartrate,
OL,16,     Fwhile another has the opposite -
OL,17,     Fbut equally dangerous - condition.
OL,18,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,19,     FInsight at a specialist clinic
OL,20,     Fwhere a team of top dermatologists
OL,21,     Ftreats a range of conditions.
